喂 喂 先生 先生 转回去
Whoa! Whoa, sir! Sir? Turn around.

346
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:42,100
先生 你无权
Sir, you have no right

347
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:43,900
把他人的作品据为己有
to claim ownership of another person's work.

348
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:44,980
你算老几
Who are you?

349
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:46,560
我是个律师
I'm a lawyer.

350
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:48,040
你还有律师啊
You have a lawyer?

351
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,840
你说谎是一回事
It is one thing to lie,

352
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:53,800
但你竟然接着又欺负这位年轻人 简直不可饶恕
but then to bully this young man- it's unforgivable.

353
00:15:53,860 --> 00:15:55,480
这就是当今世界的不公平
And this is what's wrong with the world today.

354
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:57,480
大块头
The big guy...

355
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:59,840
自以为能凌驾于小家伙之上
thinks that he can roll right over the little guy...

356
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:03,440
直到小家伙说"够了"
until the little guy says, "Enough."

357
00:16:03,540 --> 00:16:05,140
而那正是这位小家伙要做的
And that's what this little guy's doing-

358
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:06,960
就在此时 此刻
right here, right now.

359
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:09,980
能别再叫我"小家伙"了吗 我还不算矮的呢
Can we stop calling me "Little guy"? I'm in the 40th percentile.

360
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:11,140
嘘 看我的吧
Shh. I got this.

361
00:16:11,717 --> 00:16:16,251
泰德·德卡斯 显然没有写那首诗
Ted Durkas clearly did not write that poem.

362
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,900
我清楚 他心里也清楚
I know it. He knows it.

363
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,380
你好好问问自己 菲奥娜
Deep down in your heart, Fiona-

364
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:24,360
你一定也清楚
You know it too.

365
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:29,380
可耻啊
Shame!

366
00:16:29,506 --> 00:16:33,132
好吧 随便了 我是偷了他的傻逼诗
Fine! Whatever. I stole his stupid poem.

367
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,720
-你偷的 -我就说嘛
- You did? - I told you.

368
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:35,660
认罪吧
There you go.

369
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:38,460
我这么做 是因为我有此深情
I only did it because I had the feelings,

370
00:16:39,086 --> 00:16:41,263
我只是不知道如何向你表达
I just didn't know how to show 'em.

371
00:16:41,540 --> 00:16:45,600
真的吗 从来没人对我做如此甜蜜的事
Really? That's the sweetest thing anyone's ever done for me.

372
00:16:46,445 --> 00:16:48,037
开什么玩笑啊
You've gotta be kidding me.

373
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,920
-走吧 这妞儿是个二逼青年 -绝对的
- Let's get out of here. This chick's crazy. - Seriously.

374
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:53,280
我从没见过你如此霸气啊
I've never seen you like that.

375
00:16:53,340 --> 00:16:54,900
你无法想象那种感觉有多爽
You have no idea how good that felt.

376
00:16:55,260 --> 00:16:57,240
情人节快乐 律师先生
Well, happy Valentine's Day, counselor.

377
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:00,500
我们发展得真快啊 朱莉安娜
This is all happening so fast, Juliana.

378
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:03,680
是啊 而且我午夜之前必须赶回家陪老公
I know, and I have to be home to my husband by midnight.

379
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:05,680
哟 纠结的剧情
Ooh, a twist.

380
00:17:08,192 --> 00:17:11,087
菲尔 菲尔 我的外套卡住了
Phil! Phil, my coat is stuck.

381
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:13,040
-菲尔是谁 -不 别闹了 认真点儿
- Who's Phil? - No, not now! Seriously.

382
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:15,220
-我的外套卡住了 -宝贝 快把外套脱掉
- My coat is stuck. - Oh, oh. Honey, take off your coat!

383
00:17:15,340 --> 00:17:17,800
-开什么玩笑啊 快拔 -我的天啊
- Are you kidding me? Pull it. - Oh, my goodness.

384
00:17:17,873 --> 00:17:20,280
快拔 用力 用力
Pull it. Come on. Come on.

385
00:17:20,342 --> 00:17:22,540
天呐 这回完了 这回完了
Oh, boy. Not good. Not good.

386
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:26,440
好了 好了 好了
Okay. Okay. Okay.

387
00:17:26,517 --> 00:17:28,702
快上来吧 就当是爬楼梯了
Come on up. Treat 'em like they're regular stairs.

388
00:17:28,769 --> 00:17:30,634
-没事了 -快过去吧
- It's okay. - Come on through.

389
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:32,840
情人节快乐 您真美
Happy Valentine's Day. You look lovely.

390
00:17:32,906 --> 00:17:34,837
-您也美 我没别的意思 -我懂
- So do you. Not in a weird way. - Yeah.

391
00:17:34,940 --> 00:17:36,680
-你好 嗨 -嗨
- How are you? Hi. - Hi.

392
00:17:36,751 --> 00:17:38,580
-情人节快乐 -让我来弄弄
- Happy Valentine's- - Let me just get in here.

393
00:17:38,580 --> 00:17:39,200
让我来弄弄
Let me get in here.

394
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:39,940
-好的 -菲尔
- Okay? - Phil?

395
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:41,980
-嘿 汤姆 -嘿
- Hey, Tom. - Hi.

396
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,460
你好啊 亲爱的
How are you? Honey

397
00:17:43,539 --> 00:17:46,242
克莱尔 还记得我同事汤姆·麦克森吗
Claire, you remember Tom Mickleson from the office

398
00:17:46,242 --> 00:17:48,888
-还有他妻子 苏珊 -记得 你们好
- and his wife, Susan. - I do. Hey.

399
00:17:48,888 --> 00:17:49,782
你的外套卡住了吗
Is your coat stuck?

400
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:53,000
是啊 卡得死死的了
It is. It really is. It's in there pretty darn good.

401
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:54,500
何不脱下来呢
Why don't you take it off?

402
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:57,140
我...觉得很冷
Um, I'm freezing cold.

403
00:17:57,620 --> 00:17:58,480
来吧 让我试试
At least let me give it a shot.

404
00:17:58,620 --> 00:18:01,580
-不必了吧 -没事没事 看我的
- Oh, I don't think... - No, no, no. I got it.

405
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:03,040
-邓菲先生 夫人 -嗨
- Mr. And Mrs. Dunphy? - Hey.

406
00:18:03,360 --> 00:18:06,000
-巴拉班校长 -你好啊
- Principal Balaban. - Hey, how are you?

407
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:08,360
克里夫·比克斯比是谁啊
Who's Clive Bixby?

408
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:11,420
他是个推销扩音器的
Oh, uh, he makes speakers.

409
00:18:11,776 --> 00:18:14,760
-他是来参加交易会的 -菲尔
- He's actually in town for a trade show. - Phil.

410
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:15,740
天 你被卡住了吗
My, are you stuck?

411
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:17,860
是啊 有点儿
Yeah, I am. A little bit.

412
00:18:17,980 --> 00:18:18,813
何不把外套脱了呢
Why don't you take off that coat?

413
00:18:18,813 --> 00:18:20,443
我怕冷
Um, I'm chilly.

414
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:22,000
真是卡死在这儿了
It's really jammed in here.

415
00:18:22,112 --> 00:18:25,033
-让我过去试试 我帮你 -不必了 我们没事
- Let me in there. I'll get you. - No, I think we're okay.

416
00:18:25,100 --> 00:18:26,200
邓菲太太
Mrs. Dunphy?

417
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,560
开什么玩笑啊
Are you kidding me?

418
00:18:28,641 --> 00:18:32,706
嗨 这位是卢克的数学老师 帕斯沃小姐
Hi! Luke's math teacher, Ms. Passwater.

419
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:33,200
"拍死我"
"Passwater."

420
00:18:35,150 --> 00:18:38,482
老杰 别在意他说的
Ah, Jay, papi, don't pay attention to what he's saying.

421
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:39,700
他只是开玩笑的
He's just being funny.

422
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:41,080
但他说的是事实
Because he points out the truth.

423
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:43,917
观众们笑是因为他们也觉得确实如此
Those people were laughing because they saw it too.

424
00:18:43,917 --> 00:18:46,298
-你干嘛在意他们怎么想 -我不在意
- What do you care what they think? - I don't.

425
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:48,520
我在意你怎么想
I care what you think.

426
00:18:48,660 --> 00:18:50,358
我爱你 你是我的爱人
I love you. You're my valentine.

427
00:18:50,358 --> 00:18:51,340
只是现在而已
Yeah, for now.

428
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:52,540
等我80岁了呢
But what about when I'm 80

429
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:54,580
我坐在轮椅上 插着氧气管
and I'm in a wheelchair, on oxygen?

430
00:18:54,639 --> 00:18:55,930
你还会要我吗
You still gonna want me?

431
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:57,380
你以为我如此肤浅吗
Do you think I'm so shallow

432
00:18:57,380 --> 00:18:58,960
你老了我就会抛弃你吗
that I'm gonna leave you when you're old?

433
00:18:59,196 --> 00:19:02,577
如果我胖了100磅 你会抛弃我吗
What if I gain a hundred pounds? You gonna leave me then?

434
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:05,940
-不会 -你怎么犹豫了一下
- No. - What's with the pause?

435
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,640
你这假设不公平啊
Well, it's not exactly fair.

436
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:10,000
我变老是必然的 可你不一定会变胖
I mean, I have to get old. You don't have to get fat.

437
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,760
要是我想变胖 就能变胖
If I want to get fat, I get fat.

438
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:13,140
那好 如果你胖了
Okay, fine. And if you do,

439
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,220
我也会守着你 不信你试试
I'll be there. You'll see.

440
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:16,180
是啊 你看我怎么变胖
Yeah, watch me. Watch me, how I get fat.

441
00:19:17,540 --> 00:19:20,140
-我能变胖的 -那我也会守着你
- I can get fat. - And I'll be there.

442
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:22,700
很好
Good.

443
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:25,580
-你还想回去看戏吗 -不去了
- You wanna go back in? - No.

444
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:27,080
我有个更好的主意
I got a better idea.

445
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:30,600
我们去跳莎莎舞吧 那家伙也不怎么有趣
Let's go salsa dancing. This guy's not that funny.

446
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:32,240
好极了
Perfect.

447
00:19:34,060 --> 00:19:36,540
好了 好了 我打给维修部了
We're good! We're good! I talked to Maintenance.

448
00:19:36,613 --> 00:19:39,328
他们 他们马上就来 大家忙去吧
They're- They're- They're coming, so go on ahead.

449
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,460
再见 回头见吧
See you guys. See you later.

450
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,440
学校里见 见到你们真开心
See you in school. Good to see you guys.

451
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,440
维修部的人会解决的
Maintenance is gonna take care of it.

452
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:48,560
-我们得救了 -好吧 好吧 他们要多久才到
- So we're fine. - Okay. Okay, how long till they get here?

453
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:50,440
我是骗他们的 没人来救我们
I was faking it. No one's coming for us.

454
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:52,820
那就去找人啊 快点儿
Well, then, go and get them! Hurry!

455
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:55,300
此刻是我这辈子最糗的时刻
That was the most embarrassing moment of my life.

456
00:19:55,300 --> 00:19:57,200
克莱尔 菲尔
Claire! Phil!

457
00:19:57,740 --> 00:19:58,600
淡定
Stand by.

458
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:03,540
怎么了 腰带卡住了吗
What, did you get your belt stuck?

459
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,620
是啊 卡住了
I did. Yeah.

460
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,858
那把外套脱了呗 我帮你吧
Take your coat off. Here, let me help you.

461
00:20:06,858 --> 00:20:08,933
-别别 老爸 我没事 -得了吧
- No, no, Dad. Dad, I'm fine. - Come on!

462
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,060
莫非你里面没穿衣服吗
What are you, naked under there?

463
00:20:11,493 --> 00:20:14,380
-我靠 -没关系
- Aw, geez. - It's okay.

464
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:17,180
-让我来吧 -好吧
- I got this. - Okay.

465
00:20:17,257 --> 00:20:19,782
-克莱尔 照我说的办 -好的
- Claire, follow my lead. - Okay.

466
00:20:21,300 --> 00:20:21,820
好吧
Okay.

467
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:29,880
-哇塞 -好了
- Wow. - Okay.

468
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:33,900
-谢谢 -我以前也有同样的经历
- Thank you. - It has happened to me before.

469
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:36,300
她真有一手啊
That was impressive.

470
00:20:36,363 --> 00:20:38,188
克里夫 下次玩点正常的吧
Take it down a notch, Clive.

471
00:20:39,929 --> 00:20:42,281
-你还好吧 -嗯 挺好
- You okay? - Yeah. I'm good.

472
00:20:42,386 --> 00:20:43,726
-好吧 -我没事
- All right. - I'm good.

473
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,980
-情人节快乐 -情人节快乐
- Happy Valentine's Day. - Happy Valentine's Day.

474
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,441
-再见 -再见
- Chao. - Okay. See ya.

475
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:48,731
再见 晚安
Bye. Good night.

476
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:49,840
哎呀妈呀
Oh. That's-

477
00:20:50,540 --> 00:20:52,920
不好意思 再见吧
Sorry. See you, guys.

478
00:20:57,560 --> 00:20:58,060
喂 宝贝
Hi, honey.

479
00:20:58,360 --> 00:21:01,320
嗨 我就是想告诉你 你昨晚真棒
Hey, I just wanted to tell you how great you were last night.

480
00:21:01,460 --> 00:21:05,460
-菲尔 -对不起 我把油弄得到处都是
- Uh, Phil... - Sorry I got the, uh- the oil everywhere, but, hey"

481
00:21:05,558 --> 00:21:08,318
-亲爱的 -幸好不是自家的床单
- Uh, sweetie. - They're not our sheets, right?

482
00:21:08,380 --> 00:21:10,860
宝贝 还记得卖车的人怎么说的吗
Honey- Honey, remember when the salesman told us...

483
00:21:10,860 --> 00:21:12,760
他说"丰田塞纳是适合全家人的车"
that the Sienna was built with the whole family in mind?

484
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:15,260
全家人都听见你刚刚说的话了
Yeah. Well, the whole family just heard that.

485
00:21:15,306 --> 00:21:17,254
囧 看来
Uh- Uh- Guess-

486
00:21:17,300 --> 00:21:19,940
看来蓝牙对讲挺好用的嘛
I guess the Bluetooth works.

487
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:22,740
-嗯嗯 -你们用油干嘛
- Mmm. - Why did you have oil?

488
00:21:23,300 --> 00:21:26,900
因为啊 小弟 我们在做炸薯条啊
Because, buddy, we were making French fries.

489
00:21:27,220 --> 00:21:28,060
在你卧室里炸啊
In your room?

490
00:21:28,460 --> 00:21:30,200
要不你们播张DVD看吧
Why don't you guys just pop in a DVD?
